#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer.php
msgid "WM Zero-CDN Asset Localizer & Font Sovereignty Engine"
msgstr "WM Zero-CDN Asset Localizer & Pogon za neodvisnost pisav"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer.php
msgid "https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer/"
msgstr ""
"https://arnoldwender.com/wordpress-plugins/wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-zero-cdn-asset-localizer.php
msgid ""
"Checks the front page for Google Fonts, Font Awesome, cdnjs, jsDelivr and "
"unpkg references and downloads a Google Fonts stylesheet with its WOFF2 "
"files to the site's own uploads folder. Replacing the remote link in the "
"theme stays a manual step."
msgstr ""
"Preveri vstopno stran za sklice na Google Fonts, Font Awesome, cdnjs, "
"jsDelivr in unpkg ter prenese slogovno datoteko Google Fonts z datotekami "
"WOFF2 v lastno mapo nalaganja spletnega mesta. Zamenjava zunanje povezave v "
"temi ostaja ročni korak."

